{"id":"n56627-1-7","stage":2,"title":"미인 · 美人","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56627-1-7-1","ko":"따님이 키도 크고 예쁘네요.","zh":"您女儿又高又漂亮。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"따님이","meaning":"令爱，千金小姐","explanation":"따님：令爱，千金小姐；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"따님","audio":"/audio/0257d4a51a8c009c179d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15064","senseId":"1","lemma":"따님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따님이","audio":"/audio/13cb59d03d5a006b8b44.mp3"}},{"text":"키도","meaning":"身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿","explanation":"키：身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"키","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20269","senseId":"1","lemma":"키","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"키도","audio":"/audio/29d19ae3ab0711a9db0d.mp3"}},{"text":"크고","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"크고","audio":"/audio/9b4dd3b3d5bdf723a01b.mp3"}},{"text":"예쁘네요.","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예쁘네요","audio":"/audio/153dcbd9010426824b29.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0257d4a51a8c009c","term":"따님","zh":"令爱，千金小姐","audio":"/audio/0257d4a51a8c009c179d.mp3","entryId":"15064","definition":"(敬语)他人的女儿。","pronunciation":["따님"]},{"id":"e37db65fd90db469","term":"키","zh":"身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3","entryId":"20269","definition":"人或动物站直时从脚到头的身体的长度。","pronunciation":["키"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/88b2125676a05c0e7fb9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56627-1-7-2","ko":"하하, 다들 미인이라고 하더라고요.","zh":"哈哈，大家都夸她是美人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하하,","meaning":"哈哈","explanation":"하하：哈哈","readings":[{"term":"하하","audio":"/audio/69c60d07173540130a51.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83988","senseId":"1","lemma":"하하","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하하","audio":"/audio/69c60d07173540130a51.mp3"}},{"text":"다들","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다들","audio":"/audio/95e0c9a40303ff931c0d.mp3"}},{"text":"미인이라고","meaning":"美人，美女","explanation":"미인：美人，美女；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"미인","audio":"/audio/f351a6a37223c18008bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56627","senseId":"1","lemma":"미인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미인이라고","audio":"/audio/4abb1ff227035fe519d2.mp3"}},{"text":"하더라고요.","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하더라고요","audio":"/audio/f483bb8851b5e6271dbf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"69c60d0717354013","term":"하하","zh":"哈哈","audio":"/audio/69c60d07173540130a51.mp3","entryId":"83988","definition":"张开嘴巴大笑的声音；或指其模样。","pronunciation":["하하"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciati